# __PLUGIN_NAME__

Block plugin scaffolded by [Block Rig](https://github.com/block-rig/block-rig) —
built entirely by Bun, styled with plain CSS compiled by Lightning CSS.

## Commands

```bash
bun install
bun run build        # one-shot build
bun run dev          # dev server: proxy + live-reload + per-block rebuild
bun run block:new my-block --type dynamic   # static | dynamic | php
bun run check        # lint (tsc + stylelint budget) + tests
bun run zip          # production build + WP-installable zip
```

## Structure

```
blockrig.config.json      # single source of truth
__SLUG__.php              # plugin bootstrap (auto-registers every block under blocks/)
blocks/<name>/            # one directory per block; build/ is generated
```
